st of them; and `None` when none is, or when that pick is the item the slot already holds, so a letter never swaps a slot to its own content. No cache, wildcard arm or other member is added. Tests, in `SetupTests` (steps 256-258, 261), over its slots `src`, `lpA`, `sampleA` and `det` (steps 256, 257) and test-local items made as step 258's facts make them, each `FixedMounting` unless named: `Laser` (`SourcePresetChoice` of `BuiltinCatalogue.source PresetIds.heNe633`), `LP1` and `LP2` (the `PresetIds.polarizerLp` polarizer), `CPL1` (`LibraryModelChoice` of the circular polarizer's built-in item model, `BuiltinCatalogue.itemModel`, step 210), `QZ` (`StackSampleChoice` of `SampleIds.glassPlate1mmId` at version 1), `QZd` (the glass plate, `DialMounted DialNegative`, its `dialZero` known at 10\u00b0) and `Ghost`, which the test-local `choiceOf` answers `None` for. `a slot lists the kit's items that fit it, in their order`: over the items `Laser`, `LP1`, `QZ`, `CPL1`, `Ghost` and `LP2`, in that order, `lpA.fittingItems` is `LP1`, `CPL1`, `LP2`, `sampleA`'s is `QZ`, `src`'s `Laser` and `det`'s none. `a typed letter picks the next fitting item whose label starts with it, wrapping, and never the slot's own`: over `lpA`'s fitting `LP1`, `CPL1`, `LP2`: holding `LP1`, `l` picks `LP2` and `c` picks `CPL1`; holding `LP2`, `L` picks `LP1` (wrapping); holding nothing, `l` picks `LP1`; holding `CPL1`, `c` picks nothing (no other label starts with it); `x` picks nothing; and `PickLetter.tryCreate` of `q` and of `qz` is `PickLetter 'Q'`, and of the empty text, ` ` and `-` is `None`. `an object's angle is its dial reading, or its R1`: `sampleA` holding `QZd` put in by `withItem` at R1 30\u00b0 turns at \u221220\u00b0 (its reading, step 258), holding `QZ` at R1 45\u00b0 at 45\u00b0, and holding nothing at R1 15\u00b0 at 15\u00b0, each within 1e-12. `NamingTemplateTests`' facts pass unchanged. All choice construction and matching in this step MUST use step 216's payloads, including the r