: Result<Study, StudyError>`: `DuplicateStudyNameErr` naming both when a held study's `name.fileStem` equals the name's ignoring case (every `<name>.study-json` shares the kit root, step 216's rule for items); `UnknownStudyExperimentErr` naming the first name no kit experiment has; otherwise the study holding the names in order, each once, with nothing opened, scoped or linked, no gain setting, `StudyFitSettings.initial` and `StudyNotes.none`. (15) `member this.sessionsIn (kitExperiments : Experiment list) : StudySession list`: `StudySession.splitAll` of the study's experiments as `kitExperiments` holds them, in study order. (16) `member this.gainModelOf (session : SessionName) : SessionGainModel`: the setting's model, or `FreeSessionGain`. `StudyError` gains `InvalidStudyNameErr` (`the study name is not valid: <reason>`), `DuplicateStudyNameErr` (`the kit already has a study of that name: <reason>`), `UnknownStudyExperimentErr` (`the kit has no such experiment: <reason>`) and `InvalidResidualWeightErr` (`the residual weight is not valid: <reason>`). No wire converter is added here: the study file (step 359) adds the two. Tests: new `OpticalConstructor.Tests/StudyTests.fs`, `module StudyTests` in `namespace OpticalConstructor.Tests`, appended at the end of `OpticalConstructor.Tests.fsproj`'s compile list with no comment, over test-local experiments built as in `StudySessionTests`: `a study name keeps its text, refuses a blank one and takes its file stem from the shared name rule`: `StudyName.tryCreate \"QZ:LR\"` keeps the text and its `fileStem` is `FileStem \"QZ_LR\"`, and `\"\"` and `\"  \"` answer `InvalidStudyNameErr`; `a parameter scope and a fit mode round-trip their wire tags and render their text`: the tags 1-4 and 1-2 in order, `tryOfWire` inverse to `value`, `None` for 0 and 5 (and 3), the texts as above and `all` in tag order; `a residual weight refuses a non-finite or non-positive value`: 0.5 and 2 are kept, and NaN, +\u221e, 0 and \u22121 answer `InvalidResidualWeightErr`; `a study is created over the kit's experiments in order, each once, with the initial settings, and refuses a held name or an experiment the kit lacks`: over E1, E2 and E3, `create` of `QZ-LR` with [E2; E1; E2] answers [E2; E1] with the initial settings; with a held study `qz-lr` it answers `DuplicateStudyNameErr`; with [E1; E9] `UnknownStudyExperimentErr` naming E9; `a study's sessions split its experiments in study order, and a session without a setting has a free gain`: a study of [E3; D1; E1] (D1 Diagnostic) answers `Session 1` [E3] and `Session 2` [E1], and `gainModelOf` of each is `FreeSessionGain`. `StudySessionTests`' `every study error renders its condition and its payload` covers the four new cases. Acceptance: After the study's shape lands, `Studies.fs` MUST declare `StudyName`, `StudyNotes`, `ParameterScope` (with `SessionBlockScope`), `StudyParameterRef`, `ScopedParameter`, `ParameterLink`, `SessionGainSetting`, `FitMode`, `ResidualWeight`, the weight settings, `StudyFitSettings`, `OpenedMaterial` and `Study`, and `Study.create` MUST refuse a held name and an unknown experiment; constructor-unit-tests MUST pass, including `a study name keeps its text, refuses a blank one and takes its file stem from the shared name rule`, `a parameter scope and a fit mode round-trip their wire tags and render their text`, `a residual weight refuses a non-finite or non-positive value`, `a study is created over the kit's experiments in order, each once, with the initial settings, and refuses a held name or an experiment the kit lacks` and `a study's sessions split its experiments in study order, and a session without a setting has a free gain`, the count rising by 5, and the widened `every study error renders its condition and its payload`; and build, elevation and the twenty s36 invariants MUST pass.",
