h byte-identical to its `Catalogue/Builtin/` file. Each assertion's message names the file and both values. All choice construction and matching in this step MUST use step 216's payloads, including the resolved ItemModelVersion for source, ideal-polarizer and stack choices. Fixtures MUST obtain those versions from step 210's shipped model entries; runtime resolution MUST use the stored version through ItemModelProxy, never manufacture a model or use a preset/sample as the model. Existing parameter values and optical results MUST be preserved. KitAcceptanceTests.fs MUST open OpticalConstructor.Optimization.BenchNoise for NoiseParam and its parameterAxes member; Domain holds only the detector axis descriptors. Acceptance: After AT-2's first part lands, `KitAcceptanceTests` MUST build the absorbing-biaxial-noisy kit through the Library window's drop, the import dialog, the start screen and the kit window's messages alone: one material and one sample in the SQLite library, the kit file, eight items and a table capturing the plate in T and R, and AT-1 MUST compose its clock and start screen through the same two functions; kit-acceptance MUST pass over `OpticalConstructor.Ui.Tests.KitAcceptanceTests`, including `AT-2 builds the absorbing-biaxial-noisy kit's library entries, items and table through the app's messages`, the count rising by 1; and build, elevation and the twenty-one s42 invariants MUST pass.",
